      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785043977221,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Spring framework is most commonly used for building any java application.\n\n2. Popularly called framework of frameworks.\n\n3.  Free and open-source framework,\n\n4. Spring is devoped in modular fashion.\n\n5. Commonly used as backend technology.\n\n6. Over 87% company using java uses Spring.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Spring framework is most commonly used for building any java application.\n\n2. Popularly called framework of frameworks.\n\n3.  Free and open-source framework,\n\n4. Spring is devoped in modular fashion.\n\n5. Commonly used as backend technology.\n\n6. Over 87% company using java uses Spring.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
