      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785046784724,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Simlified Development \n\n   Provides almost 80% of basic functionality or usually required \n   features like registration, login , sucurity etc so that \ndeveloper can focus on business Logic.\n\n\n3. Easy integration\n\n   -> can be easily coupled with other technology such as react.\n\n4. Security  \n\n   -> Spring Security\n\n5. Most stable and lots of resources.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Simlified Development \n\n   Provides almost 80% of basic functionality or usually required \n   features like registration, login , sucurity etc so that \ndeveloper can focus on business Logic.\n\n\n3. Easy integration\n\n   -> can be easily coupled with other technology such as react.\n\n4. Security  \n\n   -> Spring Security\n\n5. Most stable and lots of resources.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
