      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785072407156,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Spring core is the base module in the spring framework. \n\n2. It provides fundamental concept of spring framework. \n\n3. Three most important topics of spring core are\n    -> Loose Coupling.\n    -> Inversion of Control.\n    -> Dependency Injection.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Spring core is the base module in the spring framework. \n\n2. It provides fundamental concept of spring framework. \n\n3. Three most important topics of spring core are\n    -> Loose Coupling.\n    -> Inversion of Control.\n    -> Dependency Injection.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
