      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785073718023,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Spring data JPA is extension to spring JDBC.\n\n2. It makes our database interaction super easy by representating\ntable as java class and table data as java objects rather than rows.\n\n3. It provides ready made methods to perform CRUD operations.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Spring data JPA is extension to spring JDBC.\n\n2. It makes our database interaction super easy by representating\ntable as java class and table data as java objects rather than rows.\n\n3. It provides ready made methods to perform CRUD operations.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
