      "seed": 172687917,
      "version": 475,
      "versionNonce": 901307085,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785074476132,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Spring WEB MVC is used to develop both web application as well as \ndistributed application.\n\n2. Web Application-> applications which are accessed by user using their \nbrowsers like FB, gmail, instagram etc.\n\n3. A distributed application is a software system that runs on \nmultiple computers (nodes) at the same time, which communicate \nand coordinate with each other over a network. These \napplications are designed so users can access them from \ndifferent devices and locations seamlessly.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Spring WEB MVC is used to develop both web application as well as \ndistributed application.\n\n2. Web Application-> applications which are accessed by user using their \nbrowsers like FB, gmail, instagram etc.\n\n3. A distributed application is a software system that runs on \nmultiple computers (nodes) at the same time, which communicate \nand coordinate with each other over a network. These \napplications are designed so users can access them from \ndifferent devices and locations seamlessly.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
